// Windows keymap based on the live macOS Vim/Emacs setup.
// Zed v1.21.0 Windows defaults were matched by action and context for unbinds.
// Alt is the primary physical Meta position; Ctrl-Shift-C copies Terminal output.
// Function keys F1-F5 switch visible panels; core Zed function-key defaults are removed.
// Thread-specific defaults remain where the macOS setup leaves them.
